!**/packages/build/

# IDE
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
# VS Code: per-developer settings stay local (incl. Claude Code permission mode).
# Shared .vscode files (extensions.json, launch.json) can be force-added if needed.
.vscode/settings.json

# OS
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# Docker
# docker-compose.override.yml is tracked as dev template

# Environment
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Secrets — value-bearing files NEVER leave the machine.
# The repo tracks the *shape* (secrets/README.md); the values live only here.
# Second line of defence: scripts/git-hooks/pre-commit blocks staged secrets.
# NOTE: "secrets/*" not "secrets/" — git cannot re-include a file inside an
# excluded DIRECTORY, so the negation below would never take effect.
secrets/*
!secrets/README.md
# Steam Mobile Authenticator exports (shared/identity secrets in the clear)
*.maFile
*.mafile

# Logs
*.log
logs/

# Test results
TestResults/
coverage/

# Claude Code runtime artifacts
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# /gorus ara dosyalari — gonderilen soru ve yapistirilan cevap nihai kayda
# (Docs/GPT_OPINIONS/YYYY-MM-DD_<slug>.md) birebir gomulur; yalniz o commit'lenir.
Docs/GPT_OPINIONS/*.prompt.md
Docs/GPT_OPINIONS/*.answer.md
# .send.md is not an edge case: when the skill's own question path
# (<tarih>_<slug>.prompt.md) is followed, the manual transport ALWAYS writes
# here rather than overwrite the approved question.
Docs/GPT_OPINIONS/*.send.md
